  "summary": "Deterministic docs operational graph (DESIGN-20261102-Q5MU): new canonical docs/.og/ module, standalone reindex-graph route, 01d-launch-graph-verify.md rename, dev/design lifecycle read/write-path wiring including doc-impact-identification graph queries, and a Principles.md frontmatter rule. Test-stage review (@web + inline) found that design/references/04-research.md Step 2 and design/references/09-publish.md Step 2 instructed a DELEGATED architect agent to run the graph-query shell command -- but {{DESIGN_ARCHITECT_AGENT}} resolves to @product-architect (Read/Glob/Grep only, no Bash) on the Product track, so this would fail at runtime there. Fixed: the graph query now runs before delegation, by the orchestrator (which always has shell access), with results folded into the delegation's context. Package 3.1.0 -> 3.2.0 (compatible, additive).",
